v0.2.7 (4 Sep 2026)

	* ui  : support radio buttons.
	* ui  : add show request command to display how the request would be.
	* refa: fix qjs disabled build.
	* bug: add timeout to jse_eval.
	* ui  : allow user to evaluate files in local dir.
	* lib : upgrade qjs to v0.16.1.
	* lib : update hotl v0.1.7 to use lipmap iterators.

v0.2.6 (15 Aug 2026)

	* ui: support url input with (,{,[.
	* ui: some readline (reditline) features: Ctrl-a, Ctrl-b, Ctrl-e, Ctrl-d, Ctrl-p.
	* js: set a timeout to jse_eval.

v0.2.5 (26 Jun 2026)

	* js: implement document.cookie.
	* js: minimal javascript dom bindings with stubs.
	* ui: paginate msg log.

v0.2.4 (15 May 2026)

	* draw : "Fair" table rendering implementationg (rowspan missing).
	* draw : Consider unicode spaces (not only ascii space) when drawing.
	* refa : Separate url and request modules.
	* test : Add error simulation for manual testing.
	* ui   : Implement global regex searh (for ascii).
